WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.270 --> 00:00:08.250
In 2012, the Advertising Standards Authority
ordered a Northampton-based furniture store

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:20.270
in England to stop advertising its prices
as 'Sofa King Low'.

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:27.180
China is the world's largest supplier of Bibles:
one factory in Nanjing prints a million a

00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:28.180
month.

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:33.770
10% of US electricity is made from dismantled
Soviet atomic bombs.

00:00:33.770 --> 00:00:40.460
Over 100 billion neutrinos pass unnoticed
through your head every second.

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:45.970
The Queen is the legal owner of one-sixth
of the Earth's land surface.

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:51.829
There are enough diamonds in existence to
give everyone on the planet a cupful.

00:00:51.829 --> 00:00:56.489
If you scaled a snooker ball up to the size
of the Earth, it would have mountains three

00:00:56.489 --> 00:01:01.040
times higher than anything currently on the
planet.

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:07.079
Everybody expected the Spanish Inquisition
before they arrived, because they were legally

00:01:07.079 --> 00:01:10.170
obliged to give 30 days' notice.

00:01:10.170 --> 00:01:18.380
George W. Bush and Saddam Hussein had their
shoes hand-made by the same Italian cobbler.

00:01:18.380 --> 00:01:23.939
Collectively, humans have spent longer playing
World of Warcraft than they have existed as

00:01:23.939 --> 00:01:27.600
a species separate from chimpanzees.

00:01:27.600 --> 00:01:33.009
Humans have collectively racked up 5.93 million
years of WoW.

00:01:33.009 --> 00:01:38.240
The first advertising jingles were written
down in newspapers; readers were expected

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:43.609
to sing them themselves.

